  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口获取针对素材视频推荐的智能封面，智能封面是通过提取视频关键帧筛选出推荐封面，帮助发现视频内优质封面素材。需要先根据 `status` 判断封面获取的状态，然后再进行获取视频封面，新上传素材存在同步延迟情况，建议等待2 - 3分钟再尝试操作，获取的封面素材仅用于当前投放账户投放使用，不支持推送。\",\"id\":\"ad.video_cover.suggest\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/video_cover/suggest/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710602404864\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要授权access-token，获取方法见该文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答中的返回码和返回信息详见该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710602404864\",\"title\":\"获取视频智能封面\"}",
